Open LoLa

Open LoLa is an independent educational interoperability project.

The original LoLa Low Latency Audio Visual Streaming System is developed by Conservatorio di Musica G. Tartini in collaboration with GARR. Open LoLa is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or distributed by those organizations.

This repository does not include original LoLa binaries, installers, license files, source code, binary patches, or private reverse-engineering artifacts.
